{% if part == "LyricsWikifonia" %}\lyricmode {
	Trou -- ble in mind, I'm blue, __ but I won't be blue __ _ al -- ways;
	__ "'Cos" the sun __ gon -- na shine __ on my back door __ _ some -- day.
	__ I'm gon -- na lay my head __ on a lone -- some rail -- _ road line,
	__ And let the Two __ Nine -- teen __ pa -- ci -- fy my __ _ mind.
}
{% endif %}
{% if part == "LyricsmoreWikifonia" %}\lyricmode {
	I'm all a -- lone mid -- night, __ and my lamp is bur -- _ nin' low;
	__ Nev -- er had __ so much trou -- ble in __ _ my life be -- fore.
	__ I'm gon -- na lay my head __ on the lone -- some rail -- _ road track,
	__ But when I hear whis -- tle, gon -- na pull it __ _ back.
}
{% endif %}
